flowchart TD
    User[User selects a taste profile] --> Main[main.py CLI runner]
    Main --> Loader[load_songs: reads songs.csv]
    Loader --> Scorer[recommend_songs: scores and ranks all songs]
    Scorer --> Results[Top-K recommendations with scores and reasons]
    Results --> Agent[agent.py: critique_recommendations]
    Agent --> LLM[Claude API: reasons over each recommendation]
    LLM --> Critique[Confidence label + plain-language critique per song]
    Critique --> Output[CLI output: table plus agent critique]
    Critique --> Logger[log_agent_run: appends to logs/agent_log.jsonl]
    Logger --> Review[Human review: does the critique match the recommender's actual bias?]
    Output --> Tests[pytest: verifies scoring and ranking logic separately]

    style Agent fill:#7F77DD,color:#fff
    style LLM fill:#7F77DD,color:#fff
    style Critique fill:#7F77DD,color:#fff
    style Review fill:#1D9E75,color:#fff
